@BankCore.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5023

### Abrir cuenta de débito en MXN
POST {{BankCore.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "accountType": "Checking",
  "currency": "MXN"
}

###

### Abrir cuenta de ahorros en USD
POST {{BankCore.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerId": "3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6",
  "accountType": "Savings",
  "currency": "USD"
}

###

### Consultar cuenta por ID
GET {{BankCore.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Transferir dinero entre cuentas
POST {{BankCore.API_HostAddress}}/api/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "destinationAccountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "MXN"
}

###
